WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:04.423
Design a cover

2
00:00:04.931 --> 00:00:10.055
No designer yet? The Cover tab makes a clean typographic cover in a minute.

3
00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:18.434
Choose a layout.

4
00:00:18.436 --> 00:00:22.971
Set the colours and the typeface.

5
00:00:22.973 --> 00:00:26.604
Drag the title and author to move them on the cover.

6
00:00:26.607 --> 00:00:37.879
Then Save as ebook cover. The Paperback tab builds the full wrap with spine and back.
